TI  - National Emphysema Treatment Trial: the major outcomes of lung volume reduction 
      surgery in severe emphysema.
PG  - 393-405
LID - 10.1513/pats.200801-013ET [doi]
AB  - The National Emphysema Treatment Trial (NETT) has published many articles 
      reporting the various outcomes of lung volume reduction surgery versus medical 
      treatment for patients with severe emphysema. However, long and complex clinical 
      trials like NETT that involve both medical and surgical issues generate multiple 
      manuscripts over a period of years and report an array of various outcomes. As a 
      result, the essential findings of the trial may appear to be fragmented to the 
      clinician or clinical researcher or be lost among the many medical reports 
      published each year. In this review, we summarize in one publication the major 
      medical and surgical outcomes of NETT.
